## DONENESS CHAIN (non-negotiable)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Nothing is "done" until: committed → pushed → deployed → verified LIVE.
- A green build / passing test / clean screenshot is NOT "verified."
- Tests are run on the real repo, not assumed.
- UI / auth-gated / DB changes are confirmed on the actual running app by Ryan.
- Never claim live-verified without it. State exactly what remains to be confirmed live.

